siriactionsd(8)             System Manager's Manual            siriactionsd(8)

NAME
     siriactionsd – Daemon for the Shortcuts application

SYNOPSIS
     siriactionsd

DESCRIPTION
     The siriactionsd daemon coordinates running and syncing of shortcuts
     created in the Shortcuts application, among other Shortcuts-related
     auxiliary tasks.

